@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam padding 8
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam ArrowColor #43556B
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
title Các class Python tích hợp AI có trong mã
hide empty members
class AIProviderService {
bind_context()
record_verified_ranking()
execution_metadata()
fallback_status()
generate_response()
generate_local_response()
}
class GeminiService {
configured()
probe_model()
generate_content()
}
class OpenAIService {
configured()
probe_model()
generate_content()
}
class LocalModelService {
installed()
reachable()
ensure_running()
generate_content()
}
class LocalBrainService {
model_prompt()
model_schema()
generate_response()
weekly_summary()
task_line()
assignment_suggestion()
validate_model_response()
}
AIProviderService --> GeminiService
AIProviderService --> OpenAIService
AIProviderService --> LocalModelService
AIProviderService --> LocalBrainService

@enduml
